# Keeps `public/` tracked even when it's otherwise empty.
#
# The production Dockerfile copies /app/public into the runner image
# (`COPY --from=builder /app/public ./public`). Docker fails the build
# when the source path doesn't exist, which it does on a fresh clone
# if every file under public/ is gitignored. This `.gitkeep` ensures
# the directory is always present in the build context.
#
# Kalodata-downloaded reference images land under public/uploads/ at
# runtime; that subtree stays gitignored.
